sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Proxy as Nginx Proxy
    participant Express as Express App
    participant Middleware as Middleware Stack
    participant Router as Router
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Service as Service
    participant Repository as Repository
    participant DB as Database
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant Queue as RabbitMQ

    Client->>Proxy: HTTP Request
    Proxy->>Express: Forward Request
    
    Note over Express,Middleware: Middleware Processing
    Express->>Middleware: Helmet (Security Headers)
    Express->>Middleware: CORS (Origin Check)
    Express->>Middleware: Compression (Gzip)
    Express->>Middleware: Rate Limiter (Throttle)
    Express->>Middleware: Request ID (Generate ID)
    Express->>Middleware: Request Logger (Log Request)
    
    Express->>Router: Route Matching
    
    alt Protected Route
        Router->>Middleware: Auth Middleware
        Middleware->>Middleware: Verify JWT Token
        alt Invalid Token
            Middleware-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        else Valid Token
            Router->>Middleware: Admin Middleware (if admin route)
            Router->>Middleware: Input Validation
            alt Validation Failed
                Middleware-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
            else Validation Passed
                Router->>Controller: Call Controller Method
            end
        end
    else Public Route
        Router->>Middleware: Input Validation
        Router->>Controller: Call Controller Method
    end
    
    Note over Controller,Service: Business Logic
    Controller->>Service: Call Service Method
    Service->>Cache: Check Cache (if applicable)
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>Service: Cached Data
        Service-->>Controller: Return Data
    else Cache Miss
        Service->>Repository: Query Database
        Repository->>DB: Execute Query
        DB-->>Repository: Result Data
        Repository-->>Service: Entity Data
        Service->>Cache: Store in Cache
        Service-->>Controller: Return Data
    end
    
    alt Async Operation Required
        Service->>Queue: Publish Job
        Queue-->>Service: Job ID
    end
    
    Controller->>Controller: Format Response
    Controller-->>Express: Response Object
    Express-->>Proxy: HTTP Response
    Proxy-->>Client: HTTP Response
